    "startup": ".tools/connection-WrapperController.cs startup batch and exact service wrappers in .tools/rules-*.cs.",
    "limitations": "Source checked DTO structure. Actual stock-client startup and native deckbuilder require runtime verification. No arbitrary success fallback for unknown commands.",
    "transportAudit": "Explicit object-null overloads produce legacy JSON. IMessage request overload produces Any response for Inbox/Wpn/Challenge. GetVoucherDefinitions and GetSets use dual migration bridge: preserve incoming payload format and use protobufType/protobufPayload only for binary requests.",
    "newCommands": ".tools/rules-audit-*ServiceWrapper.cs plus exact legacy DTO and protobuf generated classes. GetSets has empty local set metadata; native collection filters may require real client metadata later."
